WEBVTT

00:04:58.377 --> 00:05:00.087
Yes, raise your hand.

00:05:00.546 --> 00:05:01.672
Great.

00:05:01.714 --> 00:05:03.132
That is the meditation.

00:05:03.132 --> 00:05:04.300
Very easy.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.718
Just hear, that's all.

00:05:05.718 --> 00:05:07.261
You don't have to do anything.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.264
So if panic comes,
let panic come and go, don't care.

00:05:10.306 --> 00:05:11.891
Just listen to sound.

00:05:11.932 --> 00:05:13.768
Monkey mind comes blah, blah, blah.

00:05:13.768 --> 00:05:16.062
Let it come and go, just listen to sound.

00:05:16.854 --> 00:05:18.022
So I did that.

00:05:18.356 --> 00:05:19.690
But I had a big problem.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.442
The problem is lazy.

00:05:21.484 --> 00:05:22.485
(Laughter)

00:05:22.485 --> 00:05:25.029
I'm lazy boy, I love
the idea of meditation,

00:05:25.029 --> 00:05:27.281
but I don't like the practice
of meditation.

00:05:28.366 --> 00:05:31.243
So on and off like that for five years.